{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《Amortization Calculator》是一款協助用戶計算按揭、汽車貸款、學生貸款及其他每月還款貸款的分期攤還工具，適合需要掌握每月還款、利息與本金比例的借款人。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-202.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>掌握貸款攤還進度</h2>\n<p>輸入貸款金額、利率與還款年期後，App 會計算每月還款額，並列出攤還時間表，清楚顯示每期款項中利息、本金及尚餘貸款額的分佈。用戶亦可加入每月額外還款或一次性大額還款，估算可節省的還款期數與總利息，方便比較不同還款安排。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-74-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-126-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-75-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-76-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Amortization Calculator</li><li>應用類別：Finance</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/amortization-calculator/id6475277427?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T02:10:30.713307+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":284,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T02:01:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T06:27:12.198023+00:00",